      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now that you have finished the book, do you want to be counted as an LFS user? Head over to"
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/cgi-bin/lfscounter.php",
          "label": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/cgi-bin/lfscounter.php"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "and register as an LFS user by entering your name and the first LFS version you have used."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let's reboot into LFS now."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
